@@ -105,6 +105,44 @@ HALO_CONSOLE_XBOX_RENDER_SIZES
 	the Xbox's texture cache and the Xbox's structure surfaces and dynamic
 	triangles in a frame (halo_port_capacity.h), on a console whose build
